{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is found, approach and take it, check properties, and do specific task. Scan area otherwise. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectFound    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    />\"",
    "BT": {
